/*
 * PUS task — TC dispatch and service handlers S1/S8/S17/S20.
 *
 * This task owns the TC dispatcher and all PUS service contexts. It blocks
 * on the TC frame queue produced by the TMTC task, dispatches each frame, and
 * notifies the TMTC task to drain any TM packets generated by the handlers.
 *
 * The dispatcher gate applies the Mode Manager's FSM whitelist
 * (SRDB_SAFE_TC_WHITELIST) in SAFE and STANDBY. Gated and unrouted TCs are
 * reported as TM(1,2) by obsw_s1_dispatch_responder.
 *
 * S8 functions: 1=SAFE→NOMINAL, 2=any→SAFE, 3=any→STANDBY.
 */

